Files: data/scenarios/*
Copyright: 2026, Bryan Lunduke
License: GPL-3+
Comment:
 seattle.cty is the map of the Seattle scenario. It is original to
 Lunduke City 2: tools/seattle_map.cpp builds it from a hand-drawn
 outline of Seattle's real geography and lays the city out with the
 engine's own tools. It contains no data from any other game's map.
 .
 sanfrancisco1962.cty is the map of the San Francisco 1962 scenario,
 built the same way by tools/sf1962_map.cpp (with tools/map_builder.hpp)
 from a hand-drawn outline of San Francisco's real geography. It contains
 no data from any other game's map.
 .
 portland.cty is the map of the Portland scenario, built the same way by
 tools/portland_map.cpp from a hand-drawn outline of Portland's real
 geography. It contains no data from any other game's map.

